  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "烏白來　烏白想"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>張芳莉</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">線頂一陣人冤家量債</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">明明是一塊薄li-si ê電腦板</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Suah噴kah喙瀾tsha̍p-tsha̍p滴</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">聽講有一種動物叫做「酸民」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Bih tī內底　伊bē-sái見光</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">便若見光　m̄是死　就是變種</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">有人因為伊ê酸言酸語</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">身敗名裂　一命歸陰司</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">伊上gâu創空</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一塊白白布　hōo伊染kah烏烏烏</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">是非顛倒　烏白不分</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">人愈gia̍t-siâu　伊愈爽</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">真正hiau-hīng</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">古早人交通不便</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">不管男女　lóng是愛來愛去</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">便若beh來離開　háu kah是目屎pué bē離</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">現代人交通利便</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">不管男女　suah是<i>line</i>來<i>line</i>去</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">明明我就tī你ê身軀邊</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Suah愛用拍字　tsíng頭仔是tshi̍h bē離</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Kā人kap人之間ê感情　拍kah離離離</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">蹛tī厝邊koh m̄知伊ê名字叫啥mi̍h</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">真正是hàm古koh悲哀</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tsit个世間烏白來</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">是　m̄是　是</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">非　m̄是　非</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">莫怪hōo我烏白想&nbsp;</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><span><a name='more'></a></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhZ5JEny1IEsiV1hdMBLC5-jc_bFsBxvmwdXU546snFiGTQZ9HG0ld6oBwZkhuuf731e46zv9fpAJ_-7VZUWG1gwf2mKsSqf0wN4ubRsEihWFsAOfqtjHdsi_8qM_7huFs7Mu2aHJtP4Sb-WQSdoe-KYioi4ezKM-er7zNoEycCHwsCe-UCKHUsecBmQw/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1349%E6%9C%9F_%E9%BB%91%E7%99%BD%E5%85%A7%E9%A0%8148%E9%A0%815.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhZ5JEny1IEsiV1hdMBLC5-jc_bFsBxvmwdXU546snFiGTQZ9HG0ld6oBwZkhuuf731e46zv9fpAJ_-7VZUWG1gwf2mKsSqf0wN4ubRsEihWFsAOfqtjHdsi_8qM_7huFs7Mu2aHJtP4Sb-WQSdoe-KYioi4ezKM-er7zNoEycCHwsCe-UCKHUsecBmQw/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1349%E6%9C%9F_%E9%BB%91%E7%99%BD%E5%85%A7%E9%A0%8148%E9%A0%815.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /